		<description><![CDATA[<p>A new Josh Cheuse&#8216;s exhibition opened in New York featuring pictures of Madonna, The Beastie Boys and other musical rebels [...]</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-pictures-in-a-new-josh-cheuses-exhibition-in-new-york-city/20140920">Madonna pictures in a new Josh Cheuse&#8217;s exhibition in New York</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></description>
				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>A new <strong>Josh Cheuse</strong>&#8216;s <strong>exhibition</strong> opened in New York featuring pictures of <strong>Madonna</strong>, The Beastie Boys and other musical rebels of their time.</p>
<p><strong>Josh Cheuse</strong> is not just a photographer who shot <strong>Madonna</strong> in her early days, but he was also one of her friends.</p>
<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p><strong>Madonna</strong> said she was going to (become) the biggest female singer of all time — and she did.</p>
</div>

    
        
            <div class="testimonial__author-name">Josh Cheuse</div>
        
        
        
    </blockquote>

<p>They connected each other at Dancetteria, where <strong>Josh Cheuse</strong> shot <strong>Madonna</strong>&#8216;s first-ever performance as a solo artist.</p>
<p>&#8220;She was just the girl we used to dance with and hang out and smoke with,&#8221; <strong>Josh Cheuse</strong> says. &#8220;She was just kind of like a friend from the club, always very sweet.&#8221;</p>
<p><strong>Josh Cheuse</strong>&#8216;s Grooving Years exhibition is at New York&#8217;s Morrison Hotel Gallery and running through October 11.</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-pictures-in-a-new-josh-cheuses-exhibition-in-new-york-city/20140920">Madonna pictures in a new Josh Cheuse&#8217;s exhibition in New York</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
